<surface name="API">
# Surface: xAI API / system prompt

How to write it:
- Role and product context, then rules with their reasons, then the output format. Keep it focused.
- Keep the system prompt and examples static and first; caching depends on an unchanged prefix.

API settings:
- Responses API; Chat Completions is deprecated and discards reasoning across turns.
- \`reasoning: {"effort": "<level>"}\` set explicitly on every request.
- \`temperature\` 0.7 and \`top_p\` 0.95; xAI says quality usually drops far from these.
- Never send \`presence_penalty\`, \`frequency_penalty\` or \`stop\` to Grok 4.7; the request fails.
- One \`prompt_cache_key\` per conversation; pass encrypted reasoning items back unchanged and in order in multi-turn and tool flows.
- Client timeouts of at least 900 s; retry 429 and 5xx with backoff.
</surface>

