Task type: coding
Complexity: moderate
</analysis_NONCE>

<raw_prompt_NONCE>
bana bir login sayfası yaz
</raw_prompt_NONCE>

<clarifications_NONCE>
Q: Hangi dil?
A: TypeScript
</clarifications_NONCE>
"
`;

